Dialogue: 6,0:24:08.41,0:24:11.03,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Why was I reborn
Dialogue: 6,0:24:12.43,0:24:14.92,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Why am I still alive
Dialogue: 6,0:24:16.39,0:24:19.27,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Walking down a road I don't know
Dialogue: 6,0:24:20.35,0:24:23.02,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}With my dreams weighing on me
Dialogue: 6,0:24:24.74,0:24:26.84,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Why do I keep on
Dialogue: 6,0:24:28.81,0:24:31.68,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Smiling through the pain
Dialogue: 6,0:24:32.57,0:24:35.78,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Walking down a road I don't know
Dialogue: 6,0:24:36.35,0:24:39.77,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}And my shadow twisted behind me
Dialogue: 6,0:24:41.45,0:24:43.95,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}In city crowds and neon lights
Dialogue: 6,0:24:45.41,0:24:47.64,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}On every corner sign
Dialogue: 6,0:24:48.43,0:24:52.21,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}I was always searching fading light
Dialogue: 6,0:24:52.66,0:24:55.70,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}I know why
Dialogue: 6,0:24:56.84,0:24:57.26,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}You are light
Dialogue: 6,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.89,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}If you were somewhere
Dialogue: 6,0:25:00.84,0:25:01.39,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}Every night
Dialogue: 6,0:25:01.77,0:25:04.28,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}I'd still call your name
Dialogue: 6,0:25:05.67,0:25:10.37,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}That would be enough for me but please shine your light
Dialogue: 6,0:25:11.05,0:25:12.07,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}On me
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.01,0:25:13.53,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}You are light
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.99,0:25:16.71,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}If you were here now
Dialogue: 6,0:25:17.27,0:25:17.67,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}Every night
