Dialogue: 6,0:25:21.31,0:25:24.79,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Before I cease to be myself
Dialogue: 6,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.43,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Find me
