Dialogue: 6,0:24:08.41,0:24:11.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}为何我得以重生
Dialogue: 6,0:24:12.43,0:24:14.92,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}为何我仍存于世
Dialogue: 6,0:24:16.39,0:24:19.27,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一条陌路
Dialogue: 6,0:24:20.35,0:24:23.02,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}将梦想扛于双肩
Dialogue: 6,0:24:24.74,0:24:26.84,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}为何我依然坚持
Dialogue: 6,0:24:28.81,0:24:31.68,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}以微笑掩盖痛楚
Dialogue: 6,0:24:32.57,0:24:35.78,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一条陌路
Dialogue: 6,0:24:36.35,0:24:39.77,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}随影仍纠缠如故
Dialogue: 6,0:24:41.45,0:24:43.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在人潮与霓虹灯之间
Dialogue: 6,0:24:45.41,0:24:47.64,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在每个街角标志旁边
Dialogue: 6,0:24:48.43,0:24:52.21,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我总在追寻将逝的光
Dialogue: 6,0:24:52.66,0:24:55.70,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我明白
Dialogue: 6,0:24:56.84,0:24:57.26,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}你是光
Dialogue: 6,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.89,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}若你身处某个地方
Dialogue: 6,0:25:00.84,0:25:01.39,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}每个夜晚
Dialogue: 6,0:25:01.77,0:25:04.28,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我仍然会呼唤你的名字
Dialogue: 6,0:25:05.67,0:25:10.37,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}如此足矣  只愿你将光芒
Dialogue: 6,0:25:11.05,0:25:12.07,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}照我身上
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.01,0:25:13.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}你是光
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.99,0:25:16.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}若你此刻就在身旁
Dialogue: 6,0:25:17.27,0:25:17.67,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}每个夜晚
Dialogue: 6,0:25:18.06,0:25:20.04,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我想要你念出我的名字
Dialogue: 6,0:25:21.31,0:25:24.79,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在我迷失自我之前
Dialogue: 6,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.43,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}请找到我
Dialogue: 6,0:25:28.48,0:25:31.08,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}你永远是我的光
Dialogue: 6,0:25:37.88,0:25:40.85,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}为何我仍要坚持
Dialogue: 6,0:25:41.97,0:25:45.24,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}苟且于谎言之间
Dialogue: 6,0:25:45.77,0:25:48.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一条陌路
